### Summary

The only change here is that relocate now detects the new folder's sync provider and returns a `workspace` view. For an active workspace the detection runs after the transaction has already broadcast `library:changed`, so the first re-list of a Drive folder recognised only by its xattr runs without the sync protections. Add and create refresh before their switch. No open threads touch this file.

